{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sZt8ZHOkL91792663814.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港通脹略升溫，9月綜合消費物價指數(CPI)上升百分之1.9，較8月高0.2個百分點，剔除政府一次性紓困措施後，基本通脹率為百分之2.1，同樣是較8月高0.2個百分點。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_JF.HK.CPI 1700_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CgAcLxnnqP1792664033.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>升幅最大的是電力、燃氣及水，升近一成三。交通費升約半成。煙酒則錄得百分之0.4跌幅。</p><p></p><p>政府發言人表示，國際油價持續高企，通脹仍面對上行壓力，其他方面價格壓力則大致可受控。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:04.193046+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.632962+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:43.615211+00:00","content_hash":"cb149f9268530f3c1fc0767a5c2f6e1daf2b4e37d1dbc25e143bb913e4bf4133","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:04.193046+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}